            </staff>
            <div xml:id="m-cee837e4-0a83-4d53-a876-59c81b69a28e">
              <lg xml:id="m-d233ef03-e636-400e-b360-b63026c68088">
                <l xml:id="m-0c2c7580-dd33-453c-96b3-6c4068968df4" facs="#m-189c0f09-dc94-430a-9a33-922afa06af08" label="ambiguous">240</l><l xml:id="m-4820f11a-da08-4173-a2b1-ec3ff74f65b9" facs="#m-4fddb9cb-fe0b-4fda-a8bb-9f7d7be55e4d" label="text-like">Sunday at Sext.</l><l xml:id="m-0c2ec5e7-f307-4d60-8ea6-6919fecbc8cc" facs="#m-61682917-d5c0-4af8-b721-f28a536d13d6" label="lyrics-like">et Fí-li-o, et Spi-rí tu-i Sáncto.</l><l xml:id="m-9aef7ac8-443f-47fc-96e0-6453306b2926" facs="#m-b14e7864-dace-40b7-ba2a-3e6d23938aba" label="lyrics-like">v. Surréxit Dóminus vere, allelúia.</l><l xml:id="m-17b13624-945e-42db-a336-933f3fbb0bf8" facs="#m-6fec9341-0e07-4097-8fa5-6cb83a2fa798" label="lyrics-like">R. Et appáruit Simóni, alleluia</l><l xml:id="m-666c327b-cb7c-4c26-9289-6c6b5768e832" facs="#m-1930005f-fa81-40af-87f1-1fbf579adb0a" label="lyrics-like">After the Short Resp., the Officiant says the V. Dóminus vobiscum. and the</l><l xml:id="m-38440d5f-0bb2-4c83-9215-b8239da8b213" facs="#m-72292a24-e4da-46f3-9ec1-5cc37be1471d" label="lyrics-like">Prayer of the Office. He then repeats the Y. Dóminus vobiscum. and adds:</l><l xml:id="m-bb08842e-0d08-4e1e-87e5-92248df61aae" facs="#m-c95ec744-7cb6-480f-ae43-7f7b08a31429" label="lyrics-like">V. Benedi-cámus Dómino. N. Dé-o grá-ti-as.</l><l xml:id="m-bb937bb1-fce0-4994-ab8d-301501568599" facs="#m-a3e5b6b3-73d8-4468-a70c-ad39c383de2f" label="lyrics-like">V. Fidé-li-um ánimae per mi-se-ri-córdi-am Dé-i requi¬</l><l xml:id="m-36cf40c9-5fc6-47ed-9935-2593febf5007" facs="#m-8587596b-4309-423b-9d7f-d5580d77a85e" label="lyrics-like">éscant in páce. K. Amen.</l><l xml:id="m-ed14f201-0cb7-4e53-862f-0824bdd67c70" facs="#m-c22474c8-aa1f-4d0c-bc1d-ff2811a40683" label="lyrics-like">(If Pontifical Mass is to follow, the V. Benedicámus Dómino. is sung by the</l><l xml:id="m-884e4885-9fc4-4f46-a10a-5b6dbb5fff42" facs="#m-30c79100-38a0-41c2-add1-3c8a9399f0e9" label="lyrics-like">Cantors in one or the tones indicated on p. 124; and the Y. Fidélium. is not</l><l xml:id="m-f9fdebe6-d0d1-4e13-ac00-caa68e7f9aa4" facs="#m-57472aa7-c92b-4a90-a5ed-0d34ac2e50a1" label="text-like">said).</l><l xml:id="m-aaeccf61-c517-468d-80de-69f03e4f9211" facs="#m-1f0d62f5-bae8-4e66-b587-52c02b79999c" label="text-like">Sext and None end in the same war. If the Choir is to disperse, after the</l><l xml:id="m-994602ed-89e1-4c37-ab89-bc6fedf020ab" facs="#m-26c9dd69-47f9-4533-b457-7aacffa0cbf9" label="lyrics-like">V. Fidélium. the Pater noster. is said in silence and the F. Dóminus det nóbis</l><l xml:id="m-804e7f9c-9992-4606-acbe-b71e82df1e12" facs="#m-aa0cecc7-6804-46de-8c80-244a716f2b72" label="lyrics-like">súam pâcem. is added. Next follows the Anthem to the Blessed Virain</l><l xml:id="m-c721f94a-f525-4683-b53f-916dcebc191e" facs="#m-18ca0018-5b90-4960-9f64-dedf3db6c746" label="lyrics-like">according to the Season, p. 273, and finally: F. Divínum auxilium.</l><l xml:id="m-d0b0fe3f-e09c-4f10-95d0-b2848848a53e" facs="#m-3071cf54-34ce-4399-840b-9021c0b285ea" label="ambiguous">~ ---. --=-=--- =-=----==---- n¬</l><l xml:id="m-16fd0164-608a-496d-932d-90dbbeb4af40" facs="#m-7174e0a3-2fae-450f-9df1-740e1ede2955" label="text-like">SUNDAY AT SEXT.</l><l xml:id="m-7eb80740-2f6e-4d60-85bf-a28489acfe4b" facs="#m-8ccd8444-19d9-4d7c-ac3a-dc70eeb371e8" label="lyrics-like">Páter nóster. Ave María.</l><l xml:id="m-77a688ff-8be0-454b-ac15-e31193db43b3" facs="#m-a2f5734e-b195-4fa8-8abc-0eb8997e71a7" label="lyrics-like">v. Déus in adiutórium. 263.</l><l xml:id="m-4ed2525c-6a7d-4f50-884e-95d6e260615c" facs="#m-3b9e49b0-12e2-491e-a76b-365a6f4a9d29" label="ambiguous">Hymn.</l><l xml:id="m-fd800058-9d2e-4b04-82c8-3c21f4d13b50" facs="#m-0918a86d-3f36-42f8-8458-87a394e60afd" label="text-like">1. On Ordinary Sundays.</l><l xml:id="m-0da56bc0-60fa-4830-a95d-8dabf5c24db2" facs="#m-52274f28-a0c1-4eb7-8856-aa3facf10101" label="ambiguous">8.</l><l xml:id="m-6688c06e-fd05-47db-a1e7-c5ca88c471ca" facs="#m-8e42b705-1ad0-4df8-af2f-7dd1a053a297" label="ambiguous">R</l><l xml:id="m-beafa3d3-89da-49f7-b3e7-36f28a88d878" facs="#m-64cced5a-7aa3-4454-8dae-871ee64bc6a2" label="lyrics-like">Ector pótens, vérax Dé-us, Qui témperas ré-rum</l><l xml:id="m-9f486f78-d5cf-43e5-b098-c5b9ffdbf4df" facs="#m-71a6f4c2-fdd6-4399-8aaa-5e93ccde857e" label="lyrics-like">ví-ces, Splendóre mane illúminas, Et ignibus me-rí-di-em:</l></lg>
            </div>
          </section>
        </score>
      </mdiv>
    </body>
  </music>
</mei>